# Frontend runtime config (Vite). Copy to `.env` for local overrides.
#
# --- Mock-first (default) ---
# With none of these set, `npm run dev` runs mock-first: the MSW worker serves the
# whole app offline. This is the default for demos and UI work.
#
# --- Live backend (P5-13) ---
# Two ways to talk to the real backend instead of the mocks:
#
# 1) Via the dev proxy (recommended — no CORS): disable mocks and let Vite forward
#    /api/v1 to the backend. Set:
# VITE_USE_MOCKS=false
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:4000
#
# 2) Direct: point the client straight at an absolute backend URL. Setting this also
#    disables MSW automatically (see src/main.tsx). Backend CORS must allow the origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
